  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Make the patty mixture: put all the patty ingredients (including a 4 cm piece of peeled ginger) in a food processor and blend together."
    },
    {
      "text": "Shape the mixture into patties and fry in olive oil until browned on both sides."
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the sauce: fry the onion, garlic and capsicum in a little olive oil. Add the soy sauce, lemon juice and honey and bring to the boil."
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix the cornflour and water. Add to the sauce and cook until it thickens. Season with salt and pepper."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the patties to the sauce and keep cooking over low heat for another 10 minutes."
    }
  ]
